2\n单个图片\n将单个图片放入材质中，这样就会有抗锯齿处理。\n如果因为图片旋转而边缘有台阶式锯齿，需要在材质中旋转。\n多个UI控件\n使用RetainerBox组件。\n这个组件内部使用FWidgetRenderer，将子组件渲染到一个RT上。之后在材质中使用。\n如此实现了抗锯齿。\n场景中UI\n使用UWidgetComponent\n也使用了FWidgetRenderer, 因此是有抗锯齿的。\n","description":"","id":"https://looper.blog/blog/unreal/umg/anti-aliasing/","path":"/blog/unreal/umg/anti-aliasing/","title":"UMG 抗锯齿"},"https://looper.blog/projects/":{"body":"","description":"","id":"https://looper.blog/projects/","path":"/projects/","title":"Projects"}},"docInfo":{"https://looper.blog/":{"body":0,"description":0,"path":0,"title":0},"https://looper.blog/archive/":{"body":0,"description":0,"path":1,"title":1},"https://looper.blog/blog/":{"body":0,"description":0,"path":1,"title":2},"https://looper.blog/blog/post1/":{"body":0,"description":0,"path":2,"title":2},"https://looper.blog/blog/unreal/":{"body":0,"description":0,"path":2,"title":2},"https://looper.blog/blog/unreal/umg/":{"body":0,"description":0,"path":3,"title":1},"https://looper.blog/blog/unreal/umg/anti-aliasing/":{"body":9,"description":0,"path":5,"title":1},"https://looper.blog/projects/":{"body":0,"description":0,"path":1,"title":1}},"length":8},"lang":"English"}